---
title: "Zanzibar Travel Blog & Guides"
description: "Zanzibar travel advice from local experts: when to go, what to pack, hidden gems, budgets and responsible tourism tips."
permalink: "/blog/index.html"
---
{% include "seo.njk" %}
{% include "header.njk" %}

<main class="" id="main-content">
  <header class="page-header">
    <h1>Travel Blog & Guides</h1>
    <p>Expert insights on Zanzibar travel — when to go, what to pack, hidden gems, and responsible tourism tips.</p>
  </header>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header reveal">
        <span class="section-tag">Latest Articles</span>
        <h2>Zanzibar Travel Guides</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle">Evidence-backed travel advice from our years of local experience.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cards-grid">
        {% for post in collections.all | reverse %}
          {% if post.inputPath and post.inputPath.includes("/pages/blog/") and not post.inputPath.includes("index.njk") %}
        <article class="card reveal">
          <div class="card-image">
            {% set featured = post.inputPath | featuredImage %}
            {% set cdnSrc = post.inputPath | cdnImage %}
            <img src="{{ cdnSrc }}" alt="{{ featured.featuredAlt or post.data.title }}" loading="lazy">
          </div>
          <div class="card-content">
            <span class="card-badge badge-blog">Guide</span>
            <h3 class="card-title"><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h3>
            <p class="card-description">{{ post.data.description | truncate(140) }}</p>
            <div class="card-footer">
              <a href="{{ post.url }}" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">Read Guide</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>
          {% endif %}
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-section">
    <div class="cta-content reveal">
      <h2>Want These Guides Delivered?</h2>
      <p>Subscribe to our WhatsApp broadcast for new blog posts, seasonal offers, and travel tips — no spam, just useful info.</p>
      <a href="https://wa.me/{{ site.contact.whatsapp }}?text=Subscribe%20me%20to%20Spice%20and%20Sail%20updates" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-accent btn-lg">Subscribe via WhatsApp</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

{% include "footer.njk" %}
